{"matched":50,"pages":[{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0452c01","n":"0452c","t":"二卷初顯理究竟處已問如來"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0453a01","n":"0453a","t":"惟此藏性能為世出世間善不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0453b01","n":"0453b","t":"前七識有生滅耳故唐譯云其"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0453c01","n":"0453c","t":"便自妄生滅度解脫之想此但"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0454a01","n":"0454a","t":"記曰此言如來藏為出世淨因"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0454b01","n":"0454b","t":"聖悉有生滅修行者自覺聖趣"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0455a01","n":"0455a","t":"慧為勝鬘夫人說佛境界非是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0455b01","n":"0455b","t":"染淨二習之所熏故然如來藏"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0455c01","n":"0455c","t":"自性八識二無我建立今所建"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0456c01","n":"0456c","t":"記曰此言住如如者之實證也"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0457a01","n":"0457a","t":"五法分二初三自性入五法記"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0457b01","n":"0457b","t":"記曰此言成自性入五法中正"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0458b01","n":"0458b","t":"如恒沙之多何者以如來最勝"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0458c01","n":"0458c","t":"誘眾生之方便耳非是建立說"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0459a01","n":"0459a","t":"如來寂然不生一念厭捨之心"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0459b01","n":"0459b","t":"故云譬如恒沙別求異沙永不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0459c01","n":"0459c","t":"魏譯云諸佛如來為諸眾生苦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0460a01","n":"0460a","t":"如一如無二如也唐譯云若生"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0460b01","n":"0460b","t":"竟下示藏心自性以顯真妄生"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0460c01","n":"0460c","t":"有也謂一切法者大約不越世"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0461a01","n":"0461a","t":"常住了無生滅善惡去來之相"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0461b01","n":"0461b","t":"五識最初一念攬境之時未有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0461c01","n":"0461c","t":"以彼計著剎那論故以彼不知"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0462a01","n":"0462a","t":"明矣自性尚無誰當生滅然如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0462b01","n":"0462b","t":"八識迷悟而立至此所顯理行"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0463a01","n":"0463a","t":"體無慳貪故隨順修行檀波羅"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0463b01","n":"0463b","t":"記曰此禪度也梵語具云禪那"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0463c01","n":"0463c","t":"不住以破彼計而愚夫不善隱"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0464a01","n":"0464a","t":"生隨處滅盡自體寂然了無生"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0464b01","n":"0464b","t":"剎那章觀之其義自見上明妙"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0464c01","n":"0464c","t":"因此則眾生絕無成佛之分矣"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0465a01","n":"0465a","t":"本際者始也解脫者終也既不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0465b01","n":"0465b","t":"也因此故說聲聞與菩薩不異"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0465c01","n":"0465c","t":"住法故然本住法者所謂諸法"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0466a01","n":"0466a","t":"而流入生死轉生死而為涅槃"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0466b01","n":"0466b","t":"真起故云不離佛以應不離真"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0466c01","n":"0466c","t":"以為眾生示現定業難逃在佛"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0467a01","n":"0467a","t":"記曰此頌授記中煩惱障斷非"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0467b01","n":"0467b","t":"記曰此因上世尊一往開示理"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0467c01","n":"0467c","t":"而能疾得無上菩提者豈不以"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0468b01","n":"0468b","t":"記曰此言因食肉而資殺業也"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0468c01","n":"0468c","t":"記曰此世尊廣說食肉之過而"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0469a01","n":"0469a","t":"血肉耶記曰此明因殺盜而致"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0469b01","n":"0469b","t":"見不聞不疑殺除此則無肉可"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0469c01","n":"0469c","t":"謂現報生報後報如長行歷言"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0470a01","n":"0470a","t":"好樂之別及佛所補大慧問不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0470b01","n":"0470b","t":"觀楞伽寶經閣筆記觀楞伽寶"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0470c01","n":"0470c","t":"回視諸經果了然如視歸家故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0471a01","n":"0471a","t":"賀未果戊戌冬適侍御樊公友"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-8_p0471b01","n":"0471b","t":"中原絕唱虗壤玄根誠義學之"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-X-X17n0326-觀楞伽經記保字版卷8","source":"CBETA X17n0326-8 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":58,"unit":"X17 頁欄"}